
flowchart TD

    U[User] --> UI[Streamlit UI]

    UI --> A[LangGraph Agent]

    A --> R{Conditional Routing}

    R --> K[Knowledge Search Tool]
    R --> L[Ticket Lookup Tool]
    R --> C[Ticket Creation Tool]

    K --> KB[(knowledge_base.json)]
    L --> DB[(tickets.db)]

    C --> EV[Employee Validation]
    EV --> DC[Duplicate Ticket Check]
    DC --> DB

    KB --> TR[Tool Result]
    DB --> TR
    DC --> TR

    TR --> A

    A --> F[Final Response]
    F --> UI
